{"id":"c0e1663f3cc0bf87","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-navier-stokes.md","title":"Navier–Stokes Equations","display":"df-navier-stokes — Navier–Stokes Equations","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-navier-stokes","aliases":["58-df-navier-stokes","Navier-Stokes Equations"],"display":"df-navier-stokes — Navier–Stokes Equations","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-differential-equation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-navier-stokes"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-navier-stokes</span><span>Navier-Stokes Equations</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-navier-stokes — Navier–Stokes Equations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cfa80659b9d38f63\" href=\"?note=cfa80659b9d38f63\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-differential-equation.md\">../batch04/58-df-differential-equation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,\\nu\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\">\\(T,\\nu\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:\\mathbb R^n\\times[0,T)\\to\\mathbb R^n\">\\(u:\\mathbb R^n\\times[0,T)\\to\\mathbb R^n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathbb R^n\\times[0,T)\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(p:\\mathbb R^n\\times[0,T)\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb R^n\\times[0,T)\\to\\mathbb R^n\">\\(f:\\mathbb R^n\\times[0,T)\\to\\mathbb R^n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_0:\\mathbb R^n\\to\\mathbb R^n\">\\(u_0:\\mathbb R^n\\to\\mathbb R^n\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NavierStokes}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{NavierStokes}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}navier\\text{-}stokes}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NavierStokes}_S(u,p,\\nu,f,u_0,n,T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\nu&gt;0\n\\land\\forall(x,t)\\in\\mathbb R^n\\times(0,T)\\;\n\\left[\n\\partial_tu(x,t)+(u(x,t)\\cdot\\nabla)u(x,t)\n=-\\nabla p(x,t)+\\nu\\Delta u(x,t)+f(x,t)\n\\right]\n\\land\\forall(x,t)\\in\\mathbb R^n\\times[0,T)\\;\n\\operatorname{div}u(x,t)=0\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;(u(x,0)=u_0(x)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}navier\\text{-}stokes}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NavierStokes}_S(u,p,\\nu,f,u_0,n,T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\nu&gt;0\n\\land\\forall(x,t)\\in\\mathbb R^n\\times(0,T)\\;\n\\left[\n\\partial_tu(x,t)+(u(x,t)\\cdot\\nabla)u(x,t)\n=-\\nabla p(x,t)+\\nu\\Delta u(x,t)+f(x,t)\n\\right]\n\\land\\forall(x,t)\\in\\mathbb R^n\\times[0,T)\\;\n\\operatorname{div}u(x,t)=0\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;(u(x,0)=u_0(x)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This predicate records the incompressible equations, domain dimension, time interval, viscosity, forcing, and initial condition.</li>\n<li>Smooth, weak, mild, and Leray–Hopf solutions require distinct regularity and function-space clauses.</li>\n<li>Global smooth regularity in dimension three remains open; it is not encoded in the definition.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Temam, Navier-Stokes Equations</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-differential-equation.md","status":"resolved","id":"cfa80659b9d38f63","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-differential-equation.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"T,\\nu\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"u:\\mathbb R^n\\times[0,T)\\to\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"p:\\mathbb R^n\\times[0,T)\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb R^n\\times[0,T)\\to\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"u_0:\\mathbb R^n\\to\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NavierStokes}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}navier\\text{-}stokes}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NavierStokes}_S(u,p,\\nu,f,u_0,n,T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\nu>0\n\\land\\forall(x,t)\\in\\mathbb R^n\\times(0,T)\\;\n\\left[\n\\partial_tu(x,t)+(u(x,t)\\cdot\\nabla)u(x,t)\n=-\\nabla p(x,t)+\\nu\\Delta u(x,t)+f(x,t)\n\\right]\n\\land\\forall(x,t)\\in\\mathbb R^n\\times[0,T)\\;\n\\operatorname{div}u(x,t)=0\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;(u(x,0)=u_0(x)).","display":true}],"bytes":1401,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-873","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-navier-stokes.md|58-df-navier-stokes]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["cfa80659b9d38f63"]}